	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Module 03 — Equivalence Engine\n**Intended architecture** — the convergence point of VibeCheck.\nCompares the spec automaton (**M_spec**, Module 01) against the code's **WIR** (Module 02) and returns **PASS** or **FAIL + counterexample trace**.","x":620,"y":-320,"width":760,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"input-spec","type":"text","text":"**M_spec — spec properties**\nFrom **Module 01** (LTLf strings in `module_03_input.json` — export ✅)\n⚠ no ingestion / LTLf→LTL bridge yet","x":0,"y":-40,"width":320,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"input-wir","type":"text","text":"**WIR — Workflow IR**\nFrom **Module 02** (extracted from LLM-generated Python)\n✅ the actual input interface today (JSON strings)","x":0,"y":120,"width":320,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"input-eqi","type":"text","text":"**EQI — Extraction Quality Index**\nExtraction confidence from **Module 02**","x":0,"y":280,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"phase-a","type":"text","text":"**Phase A — Lifter**\nWIR → Labeled Transition System (LTS)\n(Python ✅ / C++ ✅)","x":420,"y":60,"width":330,"height":90},
		{"id":"phase-a-detail","type":"text","text":"- Cascading action-name matching: **exact → edit-distance → Sentence-BERT** (tier 3 live in C++ via embedded pybind11)\n- `unlabeled_task` fallback — unmatched actions cannot slip through\n- Bounded loop unrolling","x":420,"y":190,"width":330,"height":160},
		{"id":"phase-b","type":"text","text":"**Phase B — Divergence-Sensitive\nStuttering Bisimulation**\n(Python ✅ / C++ ✅)","x":840,"y":20,"width":330,"height":90},
		{"id":"phase-b-detail","type":"text","text":"- Refuses to merge a silently-infinite loop (hallucinated `while True: pass`) with a normal wait state\n- Three equivalence tiers: **functional / trace / process**\n- Python: Groote–Vaandrager + Tarjan SCC (`stuttering_engine.py`) · C++: G–V `partition_refinement` + `spot::scc_info` τ-collapse (`lifter.cpp`)","x":840,"y":150,"width":330,"height":200},
		{"id":"phase-c","type":"text","text":"**Phase C — Behavioral Clustering**\nGroup bisimulation-reduced automata: N LLM implementations cost ~**#distinct behaviors** (`clustering.py` / C++ `cluster_implementations` via `are_isomorphic`)","x":1260,"y":80,"width":340,"height":150},
		{"id":"phase-d","type":"text","text":"**Phase D — Model Checking**\nC++ ✅ `check_compliance`: SPOT parse → ¬φ Büchi → `spot::product` → `is_empty()` + `accepting_run()` counterexample\nPython legacy: reachability-BFS (`model_checker.py`)","x":1680,"y":80,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"verdict","type":"text","text":"**Verdict**\nPASS\nor FAIL + counterexample trace","x":2120,"y":90,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"eqi-gate","type":"text","text":"**EQI Gate**\nDegrades verification behavior by Module 02 confidence:\n**full / conservative / refuse-and-flag-for-manual-review**","x":1680,"y":280,"width":340,"height":130,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"track-python","type":"text","text":"**Track 1 — Pure-Python pipeline (~1,470 LOC core, 37 tests)** — built\n`module_03_equiv/src/`: `lifter.py`, `stuttering_engine.py`, `clustering.py`, `model_checker.py` (BFS product reachability)","x":420,"y":480,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"track-cpp","type":"text","text":"**Track 2 — C++/SPOT engine (ALL phases A–D built)**\n`lifter.cpp` (1,262 LOC), `lifter.hpp`, `CMakeLists.txt` — pybind11 `AdvancedLifter` + `cluster_implementations` + `check_compliance`; full A→D via `process_wir_batch()`","x":900,"y":480,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"4"}
